+
+   Exit `0`: `835 passed, 6 skipped in 85.55s`.
+   The skips are existing platform-conditional suite cases; no selected test
+   failed.
+
+3. Strict type check:
+
+   `python -m mypy`
+
+   Exit `0`: `Success: no issues found in 61 source files`.
+
+4. Distribution build:
